      "name": "expected_prediction",
      "value": "For the linear constraint family (rigid), N_c(w) should remain flat or decrease as w increases (small networks can satisfy linear constraints). For the non-linear constraint family (flexible/disconnected), N_c(w) should exhibit a non-monotonic trend: flat for w < w* (rigid subspace), then increasing for w > w* as constraints intersect to form a disconnected manifold. The transition point w* will be identified via loss landscape analysis."
